    "text": "capradio.org\nwebsite\nSacramento\nSacramento anti-poverty crusader Faye Wilson Kennedy continues the fight despite setbacks\nBy Chris Nichols,\n1 days agoThe Sacramento community has many champions in the fight against poverty. Perhaps none are more dedicated than Faye Wilson Kennedy. CapRadio caught up with Faye earlier this year at the Black Hygiene Drive in Oak Park. It’s one of the many programs she runs to help Sacramento communities in need. The year-round effort hands out essential oils, Afro piks, lotions and other products tailored to Black residents, including those living on the street.\n7",
